SillyTavern and RisuAI were read while this project was written, and
`docs/REUSE.md` §2 and §3 record what was read and what came of it. Reading an
implementation is not the same as copying one, and the value of that record is
that it says which it was for every case.

The AGPL-3.0 obligations above that used to follow from adapted files no longer
